            "sid": "HEB 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ico dushaka kuvuga ni iki: dufise Umuherezi Mukuru yicaye mu kibanza c’iteka i buryo bw’intebe y’icubahiro y’Imana mw’ijuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igikorwa ciwe yagikoreye ahera, Yakoreye igikorwa ciwe mw’ihema ry’ibonaniro, ikibanza nyakuri co gusengeramwo cubatswe n’Umwami Imana, atari amaboko y’abantu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kubera umuherezi mukuru wese yashirirwaho gutanga amashikanwa n’ibimazi, n’Umuherezi Mukuru wacu na we yategerezwa kugira ico atanze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyo Kristo aja kuba ari kw’isi, ntivyari gukunda ko aba umuherezi, kuko hari hasanzwe abaherezi batanga amashikanwa nk’uko Ivyagezwe vyabitegekanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakorera ibikorwa vyabo mu kibanza kigereranywa kikaba n’igitutu c’ivyo mw’ijuru. Kuko igihe Mose yagira yubake ihema, Imana yamubwiye imugabisha iti: “Uze urabe neza ko bikorwa nk’uko wavyerekewe kuri uwu musozi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8:5",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kuvayo 25:40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko Yesu, Umuherezi Mukuru wacu, yahawe igikorwa kiruta cane ic’abandi baherezi, kuko ni we muhuza wacu mw’isezerano riruta ayandi, ryubakiye ku masezerano aruta ayandi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
